# Absolute Cinema configuration
#
# Everything in this file is OPTIONAL. `docker compose up -d` works without an
# .env: the first profile you create becomes the admin, and your TMDB key and
# Real-Debrid token are entered in Settings. Anyone on your network can add a
# profile with a name and PIN (admins can turn that off in Settings). Copy this file to `.env` only to
# override defaults. Never commit your .env.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Basics
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Host port the web UI is published on.
# AC_PORT=3000

# TMDB API key (catalog, posters, search). Free at
# https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api — can also be set in Settings.
# TMDB_API_KEY=

# Real-Debrid API token (premium 1080p / 4K sources). Get it at
# https://real-debrid.com/apitoken — can also be set in Settings.
# A token saved in Settings takes precedence over this value.
# REAL_DEBRID_API_TOKEN=

# Session signing secret. Generated automatically into db/.auth-secret on
# first start; set it here only if you want to manage it yourself.
# Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
# NEXTAUTH_SECRET=

# Public URL, only needed behind a reverse proxy with a fixed hostname
# (for example https://cinema.example.com). Leave unset for LAN/Tailscale use.
# NEXTAUTH_URL=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Playback
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Serve MKV releases (where nearly all 4K lives) as seekable streams by
# rewrapping them on the fly — video is never re-encoded, so any CPU copes.
# REMUX_ENABLED=1

# Disk the remux cache may use (bytes) and the free space it always leaves.
# REMUX_CACHE_MAX_BYTES=53687091200
# REMUX_MIN_FREE_BYTES=5368709120

# Headless Chromium workers used by embed providers (1-4).
# BROWSER_POOL_SIZE=1

# Torrentio instance used to find Real-Debrid cached releases.
# TORRENTIO_BASE=https://torrentio.strem.fun

# TorBox API key (optional alternative/supplement to Real-Debrid).
# TORBOX_API_KEY=
# Optional AllDebrid premium key: a fallback for releases Real-Debrid has taken down.
# ALLDEBRID_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Embed providers (free sources). Set any to 0 to disable it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PROVIDER_VIXSRC=0
# PROVIDER_VIDLINK=0
# PROVIDER_NOTORRENT=0
# PROVIDER_CINEMAOS=0
# PROVIDER_VIDROCK=0
# PROVIDER_PLAYWRIGHT=0
# Scraper log level: debug | info | warn | error
# SCRAPER_LOG_LEVEL=info

# Optional CinePro core (https://github.com/cinepro-org/core) for extra
# providers. Run it yourself and point this at it, then set PROVIDER_CINEPRO=1.
# CINEPRO_URL=http://cinepro-core:3000
# PROVIDER_CINEPRO=0

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Advanced
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# DNS servers the container uses for provider and Real-Debrid lookups.
# AC_DNS_PRIMARY=1.1.1.1
# AC_DNS_FALLBACK=8.8.8.8

# Optional Cloudflare Worker HLS edge proxy (see workers/hls-proxy/README.md).
# Many embed CDNs block Cloudflare IPs, so verify before enabling.
# WORKER_PROXY_ENABLED=0
# WORKER_PROXY_BASE=https://absolute-cinema-hls-proxy.<you>.workers.dev
# WORKER_PROXY_SECRET=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WORKER_PROXY_HOST=absolute-cinema-hls-proxy.<you>.workers.dev
